  "scope": "27 sequential fresh processes; three repetitions rotate workload order and implementation order. Four server workers on CPUs0-3, one frozen client on CPUs4-7. Each 8-second case holds8192 idle rooms and one private pair, 1KiB values/window16. Private has no concurrent churn or inspection and includes pre-paging, paging and selected servers. Churn adds eight reconnect workers. Full adds 200 complete HTTP listings/s; page100 instead requests200 first100-row pages/s and verifies complete traversals at quiescent gates. Churn/full/page100 compare paging and selected only, returning equivalent results within each workload. Every payload/sender/FIFO, field/order/cursor, Close/EOF, exact counter and final resource check must pass. No builds, profilers or competing load tests overlap timing.",
